<title>UK: Compass 1st half profits up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Compass 1st half profits up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>26 Weeks to March 30 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)adjusted    12.9		   vs 11.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.10		   vs 2.75</p>
<p> Pretax preexceps	 56.4		   vs 47.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,717.5		vs 1,227.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 55.0 and  57.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name -Compass Group Plc</p>
